# Django
*.pyc
__pycache__/
db.sqlite3
*.sqlite3
*.log
# Static and media files
# static/ IS tracked — the theme is part of the application. Without it a fresh
# clone renders unstyled, CI cannot check anything visual, and deployment
# depends on one machine. Only genuinely disposable artifacts are excluded.
static/docs/
static/css/maps/
*.map
.DS_Store
# collectstatic output — generated, never edited
staticfiles/
media/
# Medical attachments: patient data, never committed. Stored outside
# MEDIA_ROOT so no web server can serve them without going through a view.
private/
# IDE and environment
.idea/
venv/
*.env
*.bak
setting.md# React front end: dependencies are reinstalled from package-lock.json.
# frontend/dist/ is deliberately NOT ignored — cPanel shared hosting has no
# guaranteed Node toolchain, so the compiled build is committed and deployment
# stays "git pull + collectstatic". Rebuild (npm run build) and commit it
# whenever frontend/src changes.
frontend/node_modules/
